  "overview": "The \"Super-Brain\" Shogi Program \"Eisei Meijin II\" Arrives!!\n\n- A \"move prediction feature\" delivers comfortable games with little waiting.\n- Added a beginner-friendly \"Level 0.\"\n- Additional historic game records from the Edo period included.\n\n\"超脳\"将棋ソフト「永世名人II」登場!!\n\n●「予測読み機能」搭載で待ちの少ない快適な対局が実現。\n●初心者に優しい「レベル0」を追加。\n●江戸時代の歴史的な棋譜データを追加収録。"
